[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400100_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400100_01_0010","text":"（……有点累了呢……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400100_01_0020","text":"…………呵…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400100_01_0030","text":"……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400100_01_0040","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400100_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400100_01_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400100_01_0050","text":"来，吃点零食吧☆"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400100_01_0060","text":"……虽然知道你忙，但稍微休息一下吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400100_01_0070","text":"你看起来有点疲惫的样子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400100_01_0080","text":"啊……\n谢谢你……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400100_01_0090","text":"也是啊……\n好，那就稍微休息一下吧……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400100_01_0100","text":"我觉得这样最好！\n稍等一下哦，我去泡杯红茶来！"}]
